+## Sites
+
+A request names its site in the `X-Larder-Site` header; without it the site is
+`main`. An unknown site is a 400 `unknown_site`, on every route.
+
+These only see the request's site: batches (`/batches`, a batch of another
+site is a 404 `unknown_batch`), stock on hand (`onHand` and `batches` on
+`/items`, `/export/stock.csv`), cooking, `/alerts`, `/reports/stock-value`,
+stock-takes, `/forecast/*`, `/reports/temperatures`, and the locations
+`POST /orders/:id/receive` accepts.
+
+Items, suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared, and so are orders. These
+cover all sites: `/reports/waste`, `/export/ledger.csv`, `/outbox`,
+`POST /temperatures` (the location names the place) and `POST /jobs/nightly`
+(which checks every site).
+
